<p><strong>Insulated Tabbed Access Doors &#8211; 150 x 150mm</strong></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Access Doors provide quick and easy access for the servicing and cleaning of rectangular ducting systems.</p>
<p>They also enable rapid access to smoke, fire and volume control dampers or other equipment mounted inside square and rectangular ductwork.</p>
